 "notes": [
  "Starting cards as marked {S}: the Objective, Executor: Holotheatre, Executor: Meditation Chamber, one Visage Of The Emperor, Imperial Arrest Order, Mobilization Points, Prepared Defenses and Epic Duel; the post says the {} Effects (Crush The Rebellion, Secret Plans, You Cannot Hide Forever) are an optional third starting Effect chosen by matchup, so no single starting Effect is set. Total 60 as published.",
  "Posted 'Grabber' is left UNKNOWN (Allegations Of Corruption is a Coruscant card, August 2001; no Grabber card existed in February 2001).",
  "Joke nicknames dested to the pilot-in-ship cards: 'Boba Fett in Bubble' Boba Fett In Slave I, 'Bossk in Bus' Bossk In Hound's Tooth, 'Zuckass in Space Capsule' Zuckuss In Mist Hunter.",
  "Posted 'DVDLOTS' dested Darth Vader, Dark Lord Of The Sith; 'Mara Jade' Mara Jade, The Emperor's Hand; '4-LOM w/Gun' 4-LOM With Concussion Rifle; 'Dengar w/Gun' Dengar With Blaster Carbine; 'Cloud City Docking Bay' the Dark docking bay Cloud City: East Platform (Docking Bay); 'Omni Box & It's Worse' Ommni Box & It's Worse; Secret Plans is the Special Edition Effect (not the later Defensive Shield).",
  "The post says the deck went 1–2 at an unnamed local tournament (beat a Numbers deck by 19, lost to Profit by 7 and EBO by 8)."
